    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><br>Embark on an Unforgettable Adventure</strong><br>Enter the captivating world of Fall Balance Ball, an addictive and exhilarating platformer game that challenges your reflexes, precision, and determination. Guide a mesmerizing Marble through a series of intriguing and progressively difficult levels, filled with platforms, obstacles, and powerful crystals. Master the art of balance as you strive for the best time on the global leaderboard.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496470/extras/cb6ec49979a6073c7b827deac1f63675.poster.avif?t=1733957807\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496470/extras/cb6ec49979a6073c7b827deac1f63675.webm?t=1733957807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496470/extras/cb6ec49979a6073c7b827deac1f63675.mp4?t=1733957807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496470/extras/6d4d9a9bccd2eb5f54e8f020274df3e9.avif?t=1733957807\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1496470/extras/5c8a32ddeaa20963bdb790a191d0c036.avif?t=1733957807\" /></div></p>",
